    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i’m just standing here watching everything i love slowly turn to ash. it's like the world is just... fading out, and there's nothing anyone can do to stop it. everything i worked for, everything that mattered, it's all just going to be wreckage soon. what's even the point of staying to watch the whole thing burn?",
